                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I completed this game in under an hour. Overall it was festive and relatively enjoyable and had no issues running on PC. The spelling and grammatical errors spoil this game. It might be better for very small children. \n\nPros: \n- The soundtrack is really nice. \n- The game overall is cute. \n- Low difficulty. \n- Very festive. \n\nCons: \n- The spelling and grammar is awful. 'Safe Christmas Eve', 'I better don't tell them', 'as evil as you is cruel', 'snwoman', 'all snowman and snowwoman'. There's also multiple usage of reindeers when referring to save the reindeer (all 8). There was no usage of semi-colons and instead full-stops littered the dialogue. \n- Extremely easy. \n- Not worth the price at all and it was only £1.67\n- The game is EXTREMELY short. \n- Low engagement. \n- Needs more content.",
